DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
42424::$$$message_0335_0000_0000$$$::"Ahhh... What a nice bath. You can just feel the fatigue melting away, Kane, Maki."::
42425::$$$message_0335_0000_0001$$$::"Yeah. It lost its supposed wish-granting power, but I'd say it was still worth the trip."::
42426::$$$message_0335_0000_0002$$$::"The imposters are gone, so why don't we stay the night?"::
42427::$$$message_0335_0000_0003$$$::"Huh? Are you sure, Kane?[lr]::
42428::$$$message_0335_0000_0004$$$::Maki and I don't have any money."::
42429::$$$message_0335_0000_0005$$$::"What do you mean? Your name was on the reservation at the entrance when we arrived."::
42430::$$$message_0335_0000_0006$$$::"An onsen and accompanying inn just appeared out of the blue. I can only conclude that you were the intended guest all along, Yukika."::
42431::$$$message_0335_0000_0007$$$::"Huh, really?[lr]::
42432::$$$message_0335_0000_0008$$$::[hffacechg chara=由紀香 face=哀2 layer=1 time=200]Oh, then... Can I invite my little brothers and Tsuda from the temple?"::
42433::$$$message_0335_0000_0009$$$::"By all means. I don't know who this Tsuda is, but your brothers are more than welcome. After all, the proprietor is generously...[wvl canskip=0 time=400][hfsigh layer=1][hffacechg chara=氷室 face=怒 layer=1 time=200][playstop time=400 nowait=1] Hm!?"::
42434::$$$message_0335_0000_0010$$$::"Yahoo![lr]::
42435::$$$message_0335_0000_0011$$$::Get out the way! I'm bookin' this whole joint!"::
42436::$$$message_0335_0001_0000$$$::"...Never mind. Not a hint of remorse."::
42437::$$$message_0335_0001_0001$$$::"Ahaha. You're in high spirits, Maki."::
42438::$$$message_0335_0001_0002$$$::"Duh! The root of all my worries is gone![lr]::
42439::$$$message_0335_0001_0003$$$::Plus, I got plenty of exercise today,[wvl][hfpop layer=1] and the open-air bath is soothing me to the bone."::
42440::$$$message_0335_0001_0004$$$::"Actually..."::
42441::$$$message_0335_0001_0005$$$::"That's what makes onsen great![lr]::
42442::$$$message_0335_0001_0006$$$::[hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=怒 layer=1 time=200][hfangry layer=1]Someone who wants to use it to grant wishes doesn't understand onsen at all!"::
42443::$$$message_0335_0001_0007$$$::"How unusually insightful for you. Indeed. This is a fitting end to a trying day."::
42444::$$$message_0335_0001_0008$$$::"...Especially after all that physical labor. [wvl canskip=0 time=600][hffacechg chara=氷室 face=喜 layer=1 time=200]I suppose we should be thanking the imposters, despite the commotion they caused."::
42445::$$$message_0335_0001_0009$$$::"Ah ha ha ha! Nah, I never wanna see their faces again!"::
42446::$$$message_0335_0001_0010$$$::"Agreed. I'd rather not witness such a frightening version of myself ever again.[lr]::
42447::$$$message_0335_0001_0011$$$::[hffacechg chara=氷室 face=楽 layer=1 time=200]Right, Yukika?"::
42448::$$$message_0335_0001_0012$$$::"Yeah, I don't think it's good to cause so much trouble for everyone."::
42449::$$$message_0335_0001_0013$$$::"That's right![lr]::
42450::$$$message_0335_0001_0014$$$::[hffacechg chara=蒔寺 face=哀 layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1]I'm sick and tired of that super aggro Yukika."::
42451::$$$message_0335_0001_0015$$$::"Yes, while you and I were bad enough, Yukika was the greatest victim. I honestly didn't think we could beat her."::
42452::$$$message_0335_0002_0000$$$::"I know, right?"[br]::
42453::$$$message_0335_0002_0001$$$::"Without a doubt."[br]::
42454::$$$message_0335_0002_0002$$$::"That settles that!"::
42455::$$$message_0335_0003_0000$$$::"The other me was so dashing, though."::
42456::$$$message_0335_0004_0000$$$::[hfl][large][hfu][large][hftexton]"[hfl]"[hfu]![hfl]![hfu]?[hfl]?[hfu]"[rf][hfl]"[rf][nolr]::
�